     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Following the L<a href=\"https://rstudio.github.io/leaflet/shiny.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://rstudio.github.io/leaflet/shiny.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792391591933000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1eNjRYLC4NU8FcLACk09Gw\">eaflet for R/ Shiny Integration documentation</a>, I&#39;m getting unwanted/ unexpected behavior with the leafletProxy function.<div><br></div><div>In the app below, I&#39;d expect the circle markers to appear/ disappear as the input$choices changes.</div><div><br></div><div>The reactive df &#39;filteredData&#39; seems to be working correctly.</div><div><br></div><div>Am I incorrectly using leafletProxy() or clearShapes()?</div><div><br></div><div><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px;word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\">library</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">shiny</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>library</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">dplyr</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>library</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">leaflet</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br><br>my_df </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> data</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">frame</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">lat </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">34.72</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">+</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> rnorm</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1000</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> sd </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#066\">18</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br>                    lng </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#066\">92.5</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">+</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> rnorm</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1000</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> sd </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#066\">33</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br>                    category </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">rep</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;A&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">300</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> rep</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;B&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">300</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> rep</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;C&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">400</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)))</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>                 <br>ui </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> bootstrapPage</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"c